[ti:Foolish Heart]
[ar:Synapse]
[al:Single]
[length:03:15]

[00:00.00][Intro]
[00:01.00]Throb.... throb... beat... I can hear it
[00:07.50]Something beating in the hollow of my chest
[00:14.50]something broken... arrhythmic... it throbs
[00:18.50]Try to find a rhythm, to sustain the soul
[00:22.70]The little glimmer, the little flame
[00:26.50]If you give up... I will cease to exist...

[00:31.50](Chorus)
[00:32.50]Beat, beat and throb...
[00:36.50]Beat, beat and throb...
[00:38.70]Pain, tightness, and agony
[00:42.70]They say love is a feeling,
[00:45.00]what a lie, I'd prefer a heart attack.
[00:48.00]a violent end
[00:49.50]Than this pain that burns me
[00:54.80]Oh, heart, Love is only suffering

[00:57.00](Verse 2)
[00:57.60]Heart, you feel all the torment
[01:01.90]Of the pain from love's arrow that embeds itself
[01:05.30]Engine of life, fragile monument, if you stop, I fall apart completely
[01:12.90]Don't you dare to love, it will be your ruin.

[01:21.50](Chorus)
[01:22.20]Beat, beat and throb...
[01:26.00]Beat, beat and throb...
[01:28.50]Pain, tightness, and agony
[01:32.60]They say love is a feeling,
[01:35.00]what a lie, I'd prefer a heart attack.
[01:37.90]a violent end
[01:39.60]Than this pain that burns me
[01:44.20]Oh, heart, Love is only suffering

[01:47.00](Bridge)
[01:47.70]I see the souls that have freed themselves
[01:50.80]From a broken body, riddled with arrows in the Heart.
[01:55.40]The pain in the chest so strong, that to fall was better than to suffer.
[02:01.50]Where silence overcomes the cry of love's pain.

[02:11.00](Chorus)
[02:12.10]Beat, beat and throb...
[02:14.40]Beat, beat and throb...
[02:18.40]Pain, tightness, and agony
[02:22.50]They say love is a feeling,
[02:24.90]what a lie, I'd prefer a heart attack.
[02:27.80]a violent end
[02:29.50]Than this pain that burns me
[02:34.70]Oh, heart, Love is only suffering

[02:38.50](Outro)
[02:39.30]So, heart... keep your rhythm and your pace
[02:43.80]Forget love, just throb and do your job
[02:52.60]Beat... beat...
[02:56.30]In your endless work
[02:59.10]You foolish heart... just beat...
